   the 2024 customer draft (Samsung SDI INR18650-30Q Draft V0.1 (date of application 2024/01/23, a customer draft), v2/vendor/battery/held/samsung-inr18650-30q6-draft-v0.1-2024.pdf) keeps the ambient discharge to 60 C and storage to 60 C (read; no figure taken from a draft).
