   (its own text limits it to +60 C, and the one-year row fails LO-01h); Molicel INR-18650-P28A (MAKER, E-One Moli Energy MOLICEL INR-18650-P28A product data sheet, v2/vendor/battery/molicel-inr18650-p28a-v1.pdf): ambient charge 0 to 60 C, discharge -40 to 60 C, no storage clause (True), min 2.60 Ah.
